## The 28 open items from the Detail-page feature inventory — resolved

Numbering matches Section 6 of `vitamin-helix-detail-page-inventory.md`. All of these feed directly into the still-unbuilt Detail page.

1. **Decision-flag data model discrepancy.** RESOLVED — `DecisionFlag`/`DecisionFlagMessage` is the real, authoritative system; CLAUDE.md's four-flat-column description is stale and should be corrected there separately.
2. **`file_deleted` log message discrepancy.** RESOLVED — code is correct (no filename), CLAUDE.md's claim is stale. Nothing to fix in the rewrite; just a documentation correction.
3. **`work_hours_between()` dead code.** Confirmed orphaned per the documented same-day architecture pivot. Safe to drop, not carried into the rewrite.
4. **C&CM deliverable upsert-on-edit loses history.** RESOLVED — rewrite implements the same name-matched upsert standard briefs already get.
5. **`has_concept`/`has_kv` mirroring not server-enforced.** Default: enforce server-side in the rewrite.
6. **Emulation-aware-actor coverage inconsistent, no policy.** RESOLVED — every write route is emulation-aware except an explicit, written admin-only carve-out list.
7. **`assign_designers()` vs. `assign_lead()` inconsistent actor resolution.** Confirmed bug — fix so both resolve the actor the same way.
8. **`approve_concept_kv()`'s cascade never notifies/awards achievements.** RESOLVED — fixed as an invariant: reaching full `approved` always fires notification + achievement check.
9. **`unapprove*` excludes management; `approve*` includes it.** RESOLVED — give management unapprove too, for symmetry.
10. **`update_secondary_cs_regions()` has zero `log_activity`.** Default: log it, for consistency.
11. **`delete_project()` has no log, no notification, irreversible.** RESOLVED — see "Delete → soft-delete + admin archive" above.
12. **Legacy no-channel-object Gulf POSM path.** RESOLVED — drop it.
13. **`start_revision()`'s "most recent" lookup isn't channel-scoped.** Confirmed as a real gap — fix so it's scoped to the actual channel.
14. **UAE-vs-Gulf deliverable-scoping duplicated 3× in `projects_approval.py`.** Factor into one shared helper. Pure hygiene.
15. **`add_client()` vs. `add_deliverable_type()` inconsistent rigor.** Default: unify — both log, both use a scoped duplicate check.
16. **Job-number conflict: hard 400 on update, silent skip on autosave.** Default: autosave surfaces the conflict non-blockingly (moot once the atomic job-number fix lands).
17. **`generate_job_number()` race condition.** RESOLVED — fix properly now (see "Job-number generation" above).
18. **`delete_submission_file()` has no `log_activity`, unlike its sibling.** Default: log it.
19. **Bulk-download zips silently skip files that fail to fetch.** Default: surface which files were skipped instead of returning a silently-partial zip.
20. **Two stale/misplaced code comments describing the wrong function.** Trivial cleanup, moot since the surrounding files are being rewritten anyway.
21. **Duplicated wrapper `<div>` in `detail.html`'s Submission History section.** Moot — `detail.html` is being rebuilt from scratch.
22. **`flagRevision()`'s dead `onclick`-attribute selector.** VERIFIED real, currently-live cosmetic bug, harmless. Moot for the rewrite (rebuilding with `data-action` delegation throughout).
23. **Native `confirm()` used in one place instead of the app's `showConfirm()`.** Default: unify on `showConfirm()` everywhere.
24. **"Remove secondary CS" modal — incomplete/duplicated wiring?** VERIFIED dead/superseded. Safe to drop.
25. **"Email draft" confirmation modal — untested wiring?** VERIFIED working correctly today.
26. **Pill Reset — destructive, no server-side safeguard beyond role check.** RESOLVED — add a required, logged reason field server-side.
27. **`ProjectReviewer`/`ProjectApproval` — dead tables?** RESOLVED via DB check — see "New scope items" above.
28. **Legacy `Deliverable.brief_flag`/`brief_flag_resolved` free-text columns.** VERIFIED via full-codebase grep: nothing reads or writes them anymore. Safe to drop.

