## Detail Page — Deliverables Section, C&CM (wireframe locked 17 Jul 2026 — provisional, see note above)

**Region → Customer → Deliverable rows** nesting, deliverable rows keep the same shape as Standard.

**Two independent levels of collapse:** Region header (collapsing hides every customer/deliverable underneath) and Customer header (independently collapsible within its region).

**Focused/All toggle — lives at the region level only**, applying to every customer within that region at once.

**Count indicators — shown at BOTH levels:** region header shows an aggregate count; each customer header additionally shows its own.

**Install Date — C&CM-specific field, lives on the Customer header.** For Standard briefs, an install date (if needed) stays a single project-level field in Project Details.

**No collapse-all/expand-all control** (declined — Focused mode already narrows the view enough).

**Bulk self-assign actions:**
- Per customer: **Assign Multiple** (left), **Assign to All** (right).
- Per region: **Assign me to region**.
- **Conflict handling:** when a bulk action would touch at least one deliverable already assigned to someone else, a confirmation modal offers "Assign me to all" (reassigns) or "Assign me to others" (skips already-assigned ones). No modal if nothing in scope is already assigned.
- **Not yet resolved:** all three actions are self-assign only — no "bulk-assign a specific other team member" version for team leads yet.

