## Project Status — Blanket Status + Computed Rollup (locked 17 Jul 2026, cross-cutting)

**Projects-page side of this is done** — see `Projects.md` (blanket status + rollup already display inline on the Projects list, and the customer sub-table already shows per-customer status/rollup on C&CM row expansion). What's still ahead is purely the **Detail page's own treatment** of the same two-part model:

- **Blanket status** — coarse lifecycle flag (Not Started / Active / On Hold / Completed / Archived). Per-project for Standard; **per-customer** for C&CM (`ProjectCustomer.status` already exists and is exactly this).
- **Computed rollup** — real aggregate from actual per-deliverable statuses (e.g. "4 of 7 Approved"), not a guess. Same per-project/per-customer scoping.

