1. ~~Sizing/density token layer~~ — done.
2. ~~Shared component library~~ — done.
3. **Projects page** — core functionality live (filtering, sort, column resize/reorder, row expansion) — see `Projects.md`. Group-by and Saved Views were planned but never actually built despite earlier notes suggesting otherwise.
4. **Briefing page** — visual overhaul + atomic job-number fix. Provisional pending Ezekiel's new idea for this page.
5. **Detail page, Design tab** — Project Details / Deliverables / Submissions sections, `ProjectSubmission` behavior changes, soft-delete + Archive view, inline editing + SSE wiring, Gulf per-customer channel-creation fix. Provisional pending Ezekiel's new idea for this page.

